     "<div><div>Well I certainly hope that&#39;s not the case :-/ Though I do agree that learning JavaScript is a worthwhile investment. </div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;d replace steps 1 and 2 with:</div><div><br></div><div>tags$script(&#39;</div></div>"
